{title: Jesus Lover Of My Soul}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse}
[G]Jesus, [D]lover of my [Dsus]soul[D]
[Em]Jesus, I will [C]never let You [D]go
[G]You've taken me [D]from the miry [Dsus]clay[D]
[Em]Set my feet upon the [C]rock - and now [D]I know
[G]I love You, [D]I    [Dsus]need    [D]You
[Em]Though my world may fall, I'll [C]never let You [D]go
[G]My Savior, [D]  my [Dsus]closest [D]friend
[Em]I will worship You un[C]til the very [D]end
